essary."], "t": 142.58, "src": {"t": "I think we have a lot of unnecessary desires that we just pick up everywhere, have opinions on everything, judgments on everything,", "a": "audio/t07/s03.mp3", "hl": [25, 36], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t07o/s03.mp3", "oab": [0, 3.25], "oas": ["audio/t07o/s03.mp3", "audio/t07o/s04.mp3"], "ft": "I think we have a lot of unnecessary desires that we just pick up everywhere, have opinions on everything, judgments on everything, so I think just knowing that those are the source of unhappiness will make you be choosy about your desires.", "fhl": [25, 36], "zh": "我觉得我们有很多不必要的欲望，是到处随手沾上的；对什么都有看法，对什么都要评判一番，所以我觉得，光是知道这些就是不快乐的根源，就会让你对自己的欲望挑剔一些。", "zb": [8, 12], "sg": [[0, 57, "audio/t07o/s03.mp3", 0, 3.25], [58, 77, "audio/t07o/s03.mp3", 3.25, 4.18], [78, 131, "audio/t07o/s03.mp3", 4.18, 6.53], [132, 196, "audio/t07o/s04.mp3", 0, 3.35], [197, 240, "audio/t07o/s04.mp3", 3.35, 6.62]]}, "tt": {"w": 142.58, "ex": [["Unnecessary", 145.52], ["means", 146.16], ["not", 146.68], ["needed.", 147.1], ["You", 148.16], ["could", 148.26], ["live", 148.42], ["without", 148.64], ["it", 148.9], ["and", 149.4], ["nothing", 149.46], ["bad", 149.76], ["would", 150.04], ["happen.", 150.32]], "exs": [[["Don't", 153.65], ["add", 153.88], ["unnecessary", 154.08], ["steps.", 154.7]], [["That", 161.64], ["stress", 161.9], ["was", 162.04], ["totally", 162.3], ["unnecessary.", 162.62]]], "z": [156.08, 164.4], "r": [158.36, 167.02], "o": 170.38, "rx": [[158.36, 158.59, 158.79, 159.41], [167.02, 167.28, 167.42, 167.68, 168.0]]}}, {"n": 6, "w": "pick up", "pos": "phrasal verb", "zh": "（不知不觉）染上；学到；捡起", "ex": "To pick up something can mean to get it without really trying, like a habit, an idea or a desire from the people around you.", "exs": ["Kids pick up bad words at school.", "I picked up a few lash tricks from YouTube."], "t": 184.95, "src": {"t": "I think we have a lot of unnecessary desires that we just pick up everywhere, have opinions on everything, judgments on 